<description>&lt;p&gt;Border clashes between Thailand and Cambodia have resumed, prompting Thailand to deploy AI-powered surveillance to target smuggling syndicates and strengthen border control. In Chiang Rai police seized 350 kg of meth hidden in a water truck, while floods have killed 71 people and affected nearly 908,000 households across Thailand. Thailand’s deepening labour shortage is leaving fruit to rot and the government plans to hire workers from Sri Lanka for the first time. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/article/3370692/marcos-south-china-sea-row-anger-thailand-over-iron-cage-beds-7-asia-highlights?utm_source=rss_feed&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNTnJaTW90d0tLeGM5MnZyU1l0ZXJWNllaSE5UT2NGT2lOUzZxSENZSFplRlh4VUhROFRkb20zWTNLMGtNM29JR2txWXZiak1UQzdXeXNMYWk0M1lxaFpjOFZBbFlXbFI3NEItQXYtTnpLSGxrM0VDcUx4TUxPWk5XODhuTDlWLW1lcW1BMmhpR3dmNHdGYlZDN2pqLUN3T0JabzVqY2hR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxONml2TUMzRDV0dXBkTXlpeG1pRU4yQTdxMmltV2lTUHp5UG40YXZycEthYzAtWG9uUVJGY2pFbGdQS3VrTWhrZWY1aXNQUU1rU1FWSHJNSW1GeUROTW96Ukd3V2lsUGZFVHJlcUlZU0c3ekltcG9ZcFJLMVNLUUJWZVBrdFVHYkhOaWdjd0sxQlNBdnhnWXhvU1RHY1FDMGVVRlBzV2M3b1pGNzM3Q25KMTl2ZDVrX0w5QzFfOFhUUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;SMH.com.au&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;VnExpress International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPNURlOFRXb0JxTFBId2JjaW9WaDFzajg1Rllld0NzOGlfZ00yY0xQaF8tTi00QVRfM3BNS01oemtaT0JaMXd2dDJTUVJ0eUdCOU9jM3RreWs1YWcwaFBxaUl6SXM5ZTRNaktJQ2taUk1WNDV0U0VrMmtLQnl0bVdXOG1Jblg0SG9rTm1